}],[{"text":"tumi","trans":"Tu","sep":" "},{"text":"goptā","trans":"protector","sep":", "},{"text":"jagannātha","trans":"¡oh Señor del universo!","sep":"!"}]]},{"number":"5","text":["tomāra sakala,        āmi mātra dāsa,","        āmāre tāribe tumi","tomāra charaṇa,        karinu varaṇa,","        āmāra nāhi ta’ āmi"],"word_by_word":["**tomāra** — Tuyo; **sakala** — todo; **āmi** — yo; **mātra** — sólo; **dāsa** — un sirviente; **āmāre** — a mí; **tāribe** — liberarás; **tumi** — Tú; **tomāra** — Tuyos; **charaṇa** — pies; **karinu** — hice; **varaṇa** — abracé; **āmāra** — mío; **nāhi** — no; **ta’** — ciertamente; **āmi** — yo."],"translation":["Todo es Tuyo. Yo sólo soy un sirviente. Ciertamente me liberarás. He abrazado Tus pies y ya no me pertenezco a mí mismo."],"isLong":false,"isWbwInlineModeAvailable":true,"inline_word_by_word":[[{"text":"tomāra","trans":"Tuyo","sep":" "},{"text":"sakala","trans":"todo","sep":",        "},{"text":"āmi","trans":"yo","sep":" "},{"text":"mātra","trans":"sólo","sep":" "},{"text":"dāsa","trans":"un sirviente","sep":","}],[{"text":"āmāre","trans":"a mí","sep":" "},{"text":"tāribe","trans":"liberarás","sep":" "},{"text":"tumi","trans":"Tú","sep":""}],[{"text":"tomāra","trans":"Tuyos","sep":" "},{"text":"charaṇa","trans":"pies","sep":",        "},{"text":"karinu","trans":"hice","sep":" "},{"text":"varaṇa","trans":"abracé","sep":","}],[{"text":"āmāra","trans":"mío","sep":" "},{"text":"nāhi","trans":"no","sep":" "},{"text":"ta","trans":"ciertamente","sep":"’ "},{"text":"āmi","trans":"yo","sep":""}]]},{"number":"6","text":["bhakati-vinoda,        kā̐diyā śaraṇa,","        la’yechhe tomāra pāya","kṣami’ aparādha,    nāme ruchi diyā,","        pālana karahe tāya"],"word_by_word":["**bhakati-vinoda** — BhaktiVinod; **kāndiyā** — llorando; **śaraṇa** — refugio; **la’yechhe** — ha tomado; **tomāra** — Tus; **pāya** — pies; **kṣami’** — olvidando; **aparādha** — ofensas; **nāme** — por Tu Nombre; **ruchi** — gusto; **diyā** — dando; **pālana